cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MUST — Monitoring & Understanding SpatioTemporal Flood Risk Toolkit"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  An interactive flood-risk dashboard for East Africa. MUST replays daily
  exceedance-probability fields derived from the ECMWF IFS ensemble against
  recorded impacts, so analysts can see flood risk evolve day by day through a
  calendar-map index and per-day storymaps. Fields are derived on demand from an
  Icechunk store by a companion titiler-xarray service.
keywords:
  - flood-risk
  - East Africa
  - exceedance-probability
  - ECMWF
  - early-warning
  - geospatial
  - data-visualization
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bkoome/MUST-Code-for-earth"
